<view class="page"><view class="brand">A LITTLE HELP.</view><view class="title">从一个想法，<view>到一份可执行的计划。</view></view><view class="subtitle">AI 只生成草案，你确认后才加入日程。</view><button wx:if="!signedIn" class="primary" bindtap="login">微信登录后开始</button><block wx:else><view class="card"><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="4000" placeholder="例如：周五前写完项目方案，总共三小时，明天下午开始。"/><view class="meta">{{text.length}} / 4000</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || !access.canUse}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="generate">{{busy?'正在整理你的计划…':'生成任务草案'}}</button><view class="muted">今日 {{access.dailyUsed}} / {{access.dailyLimit}} 次。每次有效请求计一次，失败也计次。</view><view class="error" wx:if="error">{{error}}</view><view class="muted">仅在主动生成时，将这里输入的描述发送至博约模型服务。</view></view><view class="section" wx:if="drafts.length">任务草案</view><view class="subtitle">{{summary}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="index"><view class="row" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="select"><view class="name">{{item.selected?'☑':'□'}} {{item.title}}</view></view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><view class="label">耗时（分钟）</view><input type="number" value="{{item.minutes}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">截止日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{item.deadline}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="deadline" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{item.deadline}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">最早开始日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{item.notBefore}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="notBefore" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{item.notBefore || '未指定'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">最早开始时间</view><picker mode="time" disabled="{{!item.notBefore}}" value="{{item.notBeforeTime}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="notBeforeTime" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{item.notBeforeTime || '未指定'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">截止时间</view><picker mode="time" disabled="{{!item.deadline}}" value="{{item.deadlineTime}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="deadlineTime" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{item.deadlineTime || '未指定'}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="muted">{{item.notes}}</view></view><view wx:if="drafts.length"><button class="primary" disabled="{{!access.canUse}}" bindtap="accept">确认选中任务并安排</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="discard">放弃草案</button></view></block></view>
